{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1573,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "55de4ce263af14817647562a7fd0854a4cb17a23",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddfc2358485574177ceaa0b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也把菜单轻松搞……\r\n轻……香脆轻松……哎呀！？\r\n突然好想吃香脆的法式薄饼了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e637a4faf586951cb37341d0ccb61251b0a67e034cb3f77f358af30ef95c5b01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f83d9506582e7a572e15f439",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔――！总觉得，连脚步声\r\n都和平时不同，变得好安分啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec38fe6fc1dfed7b719ab434edcd5cc9efc1e85d6691c7751b596cf1367c818",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cfb6331b6026bb8f6efdf83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嗯，我懂了！\r\n今天不是训练的日子！\r\n我们一起出去玩吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c998c06c0e6ddc0241dc98bf3ba609cfaaa60822cfa85fe3dd9b07c871863806",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9daa94147ad9ac3e9f0f8a76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平时命运之声总会在背后推我一把的……\r\n今天却相反，就像是被什么东西\r\n往后拽着一样……唔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a72fddaca0767a2846709af3e140540a93fd931f8d02a1f0980d912a40231e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aec51cf4079379f6bb06d26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『命运之声』\r\n正在疯狂打连环夺命call啊！？\r\n大喊着『快住手』……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "819e0a8390ab3343dd55e8c6b79c267958da07c55984db6bc4b8511a795ce7a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3985c7194e7f6015be86418e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……这真的是你的意志吗？\r\n现在的我，\r\n已经有些搞不懂你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc63897c92a9912ae915ba7758353cda89a4eba160b444910e328f1c39b4bbac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4f24cafce24b5169d042d80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "声音，从大清早就在回响了。\r\n我明白的……\r\n今天正是命运降临的时刻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e55e6f0ebac88e942728dab9f2a150818ef4feebfae2dac7f39ed152c1f2f51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80c3083912bc308a88a52900",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一刻，我们\r\n早已等候多时！用我的双腿，\r\n伴着你的呼喊，纵情贯穿命运吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb4942c10d688dedc6d5895079ad581f144c34aa333c1e5721307c942a2eaa0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04ff2f3acce374c32aee1c1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲破极限的天球，通往无限命运的\r\n道路，由我来开拓！今天\r\n将要引发的，没错！就是宇宙大爆炸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b439f6a89fe394d3e814abb506051b4d111acbd495bdf3a0c6807d94c4fca352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec9ebdf052d2a1197b65699",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完全和计划的一样！那是理所当然的！\r\n因为，这可是我和你\r\n齐心协力努力至今的成果啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42401c754992c172936085b7b598875b2b3225aa80c0596f2bd82de768ac6775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c846ae1324b71da67e6d4c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的双腿，你的后盾支援，\r\n今天就要在此处开拓出未来！\r\n来吧，让命运回响起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0053d6c23358e573b135f7a8efd51ed578c65702191461137e83cd923061b449",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ead8fe41b4238942c4a0727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很期待我的奔跑吧！？\r\n但我可不会仅仅“如你所料”就结束！\r\n我要彻底超越你的想象！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1903367a102ea1e1362c9cbaecaacd23c8caddd485e626a14973dae127a77bc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51ce1ac998c5c367959e4101",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态普通！\r\n和平时那个如出一辙的我！\r\n换句话说！那就是绝对能赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c2686d9b2d90eb6ffc3bd6cfb99c8762822f1fc4c2409d40037520129ff744e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e990e45aaa3abeb317356ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从早上开始就激动不已！\r\n胸口这股莫名的悸动……大家听到\r\n命运之声的日子，难道就是今天吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "057e53eea5ecc925ed7ce494496ebef96df810d472d3538076885d8cb2fde924",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaf95f7db6dced41439c554e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做好心理准备吧。\r\n因为我马上就会让你见识到\r\n令人心跳加速大呼过瘾的精彩表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f8e2f2ab13de6b2d55737381954d285e54d665bf7f1f239dba7ffa4b39bc42f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ec6d9d12408cd6912c68c34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态如何根本无关紧要！\r\n我只要拼尽全力，去完成唯有我\r\n才能做到的使命就行了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08b75c6274b961099a1f0434397480a4cf64641c08884c187911080fb11edbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:069bd4f884624bb323142d6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要说状态不佳有什么影响……大概也就是\r\n太兴奋很难睡得着吧！\r\n因为太期待赛事了！所以没问题的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90407ee0caf6abfe3c3fbc5f7a6502c0b3cbe1f4dcc68642701ecf5e86a8cd48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5edd749171e22b14d120734c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没事的，通往胜利的道路\r\n我已经看得清清楚楚！剩下所需要的\r\n……嗯！就是你在背后推我一把了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "676fb8509c81d73387271ef9f28cb33a0f2c51ccc6f189b7e28b85e18102ffab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6970aaaa44f88f94a2c4f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你没有任何错误。\r\n因为接下来……\r\n我就要让你亲眼见识命运的大逆转！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ec9c9170c3f4fc000ff5809278de3b5179b56e849ac06782c6d9c2a421e2ee8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a256f5e5ec5d7af2f1487408",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的心……现在，正噗通噗通狂跳！\r\n跨越千钧一发的极限胜负，\r\n去开拓未知的命运吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa4e02386a687537c7ccfb7158732ca25e00de0bae74073ca62d0795f60dec6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e104f57d316c26bc3afafaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表情很担忧嘛！那就说好了！\r\n看我用我的奔跑，把你的脸庞\r\n涂满灿烂耀眼的笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df18e0f6930962c4fe0917664ffe165b25b9ad36492d656cf21ff1366707292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04203c6d64515b64991e25f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae969104f8945a333521f8f33beb56b4d63e0abf37794e7ece0e0832f7a5356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddc15e36fdf3672d246a39d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "473b6a2acb2d8cfec9b5252fb7239c795cc8ad473460f43050df98f509964a34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc14d49ef639cfb2396f82ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好期待啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa73eb42cacf90aa701bb8f1bc1126fffe82c55f8cf767604ddab373e4e0ffc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55df2c949f1912e889b1ab55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "367c3c090bb0cb242aae593bde2fb66986290df1f64be4ff8c71e7ff2ddb1029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:009e540d16e57889087512b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7523a9e48d63e72f2e050b875720b859401b4fa2c48d277ea7edb9ab7bc4799",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be802925966451a3fe1d63f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "059c0f0b27929aa87c5b6a7985342939a8bd1bae2a57b570e54c591e8e612bb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b88c40eb5db2eb4909d908f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走起走起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "635adf7b084fcc6372e72bab16d2261c30f25db34c3ce2b156b539bfc75bfc1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebe8b73c0e309d59e1602224",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无限大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5d6cf10a4bae576f4e748706d57be7ddcabfe9db29dae359ad7465446ece18c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52d4cb1b21c6280bb26c0a3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是你的呼喊，在背后推了我一把！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74e8596313320393f93a5e0db90bcd9d8d02c7e63c73f9e77ec2b440694f9d84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ce53e11dbe77e34fe4a3e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你在一起超开心的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bd3511767f5f63dcce3ac8084b5227980549ad92198ebb0c08c1db204869718",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c54217c4b18704dd2c2fda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "道路由我来开拓！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af92a9efaa802a99f8d55877dd7cc2495cd7a231b67ac02857d361c5961cc996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de33733b99252637efad0ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一同倾听命运的声音吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "377b70ea6c58cb480cdc38fa5e06d48df8c05bd06189d2de40dfa303baf94d7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92213e2ace46e99e8094210e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你在一起超开心的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bd3511767f5f63dcce3ac8084b5227980549ad92198ebb0c08c1db204869718",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edf941994b6e3007827c36ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很期待我的奔跑吧！？\r\n但我可不会仅仅“如你所料”就结束！\r\n我要彻底超越你的想象！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1903367a102ea1e1362c9cbaecaacd23c8caddd485e626a14973dae127a77bc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1269c9c3f4a8ee5a8fdce04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲破极限的天球，通往无限命运的\r\n道路，由我来开拓！今天\r\n将要引发的，没错！就是宇宙大爆炸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b439f6a89fe394d3e814abb506051b4d111acbd495bdf3a0c6807d94c4fca352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54f3f2f3608c5b0b358c9cad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你在一起超开心的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bd3511767f5f63dcce3ac8084b5227980549ad92198ebb0c08c1db204869718",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b85e217fe4467ab402adf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae969104f8945a333521f8f33beb56b4d63e0abf37794e7ece0e0832f7a5356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9bb43b6c3559a8c0755d295",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "声音，没有传达到吗。下次我一定会让它响彻云霄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82203d907513210413c35220cf500a8d38ad12cf17b4330dbe780ee3af2ba534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53d41f548b91d1a542940e49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还早着呢！我的命运，还在更遥远的前方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "086e5fa697e69cc29f25df1e60a47d21de8c69be4064d009c5e6e44a115c2593",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daa8285d1ca8031b12b3ada0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样可传达不到任何人心底……还要，更强有力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74653f044f0a96506d5bfb0eb9624deee0e6451c24f5824e0638081c29ed6c73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2136d2b1a4f18ce1bdf688",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔！？这可真是意想不到的展开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c96b7ceb1e58e5e1f36dc033a7c3a5585866c66fbb8f572ddeb6f87ce7b90e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae31d42bd384fe90582dd16f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到了吗？属于你的命运。既然如此……就勇往直前吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ab95040b0df9f198d2e8a6d2b52bdf84eb940f1d8a1919dee1ce12e968983b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5647fcc0fd4a2f94097029a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿下了！没错，胜利和……你的笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea213722ca5c64069675c42b9369c91f8a1fb5f10064ccc79bfc4c0855f76c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9565d603c1baf22d418ff996",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等着瞧吧，命运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad48c25deb51358b342894c9d5453dee20c4c0c70604f989267b0572cc0963db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9d8857c49d55386a1acd7d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "响彻吧……命运之声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1064cb6a7333e19e97c971c6ef1533914a6bc19a1c5d2a453ab47f5e356504a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5658786c8e084dde3f2b4280",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有声音传来……！没错，就是现在！\r\n来，侧耳倾听！\r\n你们的命运，正在诉说着什么！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca39aa86ced3343f1c61e9b09b73b8562b337948a239e501d53771dbc7515130",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46ba33447e39ced72769a38b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最棒的优胜演出要开始了！没错，轮到我登场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f32d8cd6fae209c672b555ff5b696f8b5c6ea83efdcb31ca9d6470edd6b14f4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03a82e166c5d1a80dd48e6ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽情释放吧……这份狂热与期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4ca8f6161740f88d66f659e870deb85fd1b17b6cad0f0a456e0eeb95f83e33f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2ac14754ea4e83a8e633e50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然还是得靠你啊，命运也是这么说的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3473afbb7781a117de32d18b44fe9ea2e7d4dffd67af043db480233c1f7358c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:039490eaa149a8b26aa5fc89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那天早晨，从睁开眼的那一刻起\r\n我心中就涌动着按捺不住的兴奋！\r\n没错，那是极其浩大的命运预感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "215cbb4057f8b452dceebeec430d746c6f59a56d170cd1fa69e7c0ed9682ce42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bd749d9379f34329b6483d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢制服！因为这能让我\r\n深切感受到自己的使命与命运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c06c275be017291ad2c1a51f1eeb314231c7490ba23af2c2e26ce68ff530bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47bacf2590c6c0b0d99d8801",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想跳舞了吗！？既然如此，\r\n赶紧把音乐放起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a31bc50b7c3be20d51fe68b054fda58c5d1625c0de3428a0daa2c003a46d55d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f9cb6cef4d081f21be4844b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是比任何恒星都要闪耀的胜负服！\r\n一旦跑起来，大家的命运也会被一同照亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59f92059388b00512c30a0c2f22d7baec75ff387a6fb036c175832d8531462e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27af4af363ee2d98736797c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是蹦是跳还是飞扑\r\n都绝对不会破，真是靠得住的搭档！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03437d46b9c5b672dd9a8ef91110da8f1f987f8e50d1a4f7f8a9ec32991b8b12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6192ec421177cbf2c29a8e04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凭借我这么响亮的脚步声，\r\n用舞步当场演奏乐曲也是完全可行的呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ad4f01d4246922dd69f4072ceff2a9f5649bcfd319ac42df81ddd4cf0bff8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5e0617eafe156126ae68701",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奔跑时斗篷迎风猎猎作响的声音！\r\n简直让人欲罢不能啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec26106dd3032951286e25705bebf2ca6221910d147c1de2e4cd0110d59c5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98012913177ebb51414c5ff1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是命运啊！我正想尝试换穿各种衣服呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3538a24d502d35c09864e12020238208b802259e993388cff9580af8e2285c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f41bd79e05cb93ebe276ada",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是什么衣服，我都能以最棒的姿态\r\n驾驭给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f5b9c2e900c134662c1869084077eae9369c1977fca27d10ff6764ff7e6aadc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:094698964ed1ff8e10f763ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "便于活动是绝对不可动摇的条件！\r\n只要穿上就会忍不住想跑出去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fee88efd234e5c44d52f09203b3a04d480bb5e3eaa6fc04054d003fff432e4ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd93c074814a2c37e38506f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去高山还是深谷，又或者是大海！？来吧，要去哪！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "63021eb8cf2265fd5ab4782fcf8abaffcf0c866fffe21a6370f1303f83b2ae14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4660d1d74d8009df05579d70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢制服！因为这能让我\r\n深切感受到自己的使命与命运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c06c275be017291ad2c1a51f1eeb314231c7490ba23af2c2e26ce68ff530bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af4dd3ea970b157e5aa0f457",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想跳舞了吗！？既然如此，\r\n赶紧把音乐放起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a31bc50b7c3be20d51fe68b054fda58c5d1625c0de3428a0daa2c003a46d55d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d9b504cdb4fc1e1031d735",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是比任何恒星都要闪耀的胜负服！\r\n一旦跑起来，大家的命运也会被一同照亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59f92059388b00512c30a0c2f22d7baec75ff387a6fb036c175832d8531462e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:211087190927cabc532f0f3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是蹦是跳还是飞扑\r\n都绝对不会破，真是靠得住的搭档！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03437d46b9c5b672dd9a8ef91110da8f1f987f8e50d1a4f7f8a9ec32991b8b12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb7d5edde4522d9755e5a5ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凭借我这么响亮的脚步声，\r\n用舞步当场演奏乐曲也是完全可行的呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ad4f01d4246922dd69f4072ceff2a9f5649bcfd319ac42df81ddd4cf0bff8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5adbbb0a1fed25958bee560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奔跑时斗篷迎风猎猎作响的声音！\r\n简直让人欲罢不能啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec26106dd3032951286e25705bebf2ca6221910d147c1de2e4cd0110d59c5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d8eca70e2d2ede7cfbd445",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是命运啊！我正想尝试换穿各种衣服呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3538a24d502d35c09864e12020238208b802259e993388cff9580af8e2285c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79bf803cb8649650f78d8ab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是什么衣服，我都能以最棒的姿态\r\n驾驭给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f5b9c2e900c134662c1869084077eae9369c1977fca27d10ff6764ff7e6aadc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5274fd6776cf0a0332bd345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f70d041ed0d8780cf21a3fb1a7856a20c5dd25dd2287abaff00cfb80bed392",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0efdefcb0f3b45b92c4fab4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好不容易开始了新的一天，\r\n睡眼惺忪发懵可太浪费了！\r\n来吧，今天你想做些什么！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba49c6fb97719fff381f8edc6c48a50193ce698753b58f71f8bd9f29e1867c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:289b6f794e79bec3fd300db7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闹钟？我才不用呢！自然醒的时间！\n那就是当天我的命运！\n也是最完美的时刻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a2dd845b27e1b5b9105b0d874a449b1a6978952d886c15e9d57d20638ed459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b108f972de33f388a0cf549",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食堂推出了期间限定的甜品哦！\r\n肚子饿了吗？\r\n哎呀甜品是用另一个胃装的啦！走起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76420711e33bc063609eb2bef7e8201a2053fde909a41d27c384d89466cacda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e00f8a3fd718d67d89436d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休是为了什么而存在的？\r\n当然是为了痛痛快快找乐子啊！躲避球吗！\r\n还是抓人游戏！什么我都奉陪到底！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5272420c1ef08e737e763dafadb99e36f0e94b876f424b352b7e7e59a476b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ef31eb99ac07f9cc1fd6e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪有那么容易睡得着啊！\r\n今天还没做完想做的事！明天要做的事！\r\n脑子里接二连三不断冒出来呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "136234a36095cdbffe2ab5176a33c89a0a854c6efe5a698f95c33785754f6b06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1245c1c2c9a9c28d9989d54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吉兆吩咐过晚上要安静！\n这可是个好机会！我早就想试一次\n在完全无声的状态下能做到多少事了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f7629c2f04fe69ebe5ffe65cb021e98aa28a00788a197789282c12302a48ae7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b09f96df21902994d457789e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家快醒醒！！……啊，我是在呼唤\n还在冬眠中的生物啦！因为想让它们\n早点沐浴在这明媚春光里嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9033e4c2e7b3fdafa00589c68cd2857405440170f0b70e0148fb8cb723aec54b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a1ad8f8cefa3e39a33610c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大家都喊热死了热死了，但我倒挺\r\n喜欢的！就像是在与我体内的\r\n澎湃热情相互呼应一样不是吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "586dc1a48b16c9e440ad72349c508bc19ab4fcc6e79ebc925f9bfbf618838e05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0202e0dc230c25ba26c8cebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好吃！太好吃了！吃什么都超美味！\r\n真不愧是食欲之秋――\r\n呃不对，我平时好像一直都这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5630b042a44c8f260e533f7dc99b4b62e8c1293109af4c9f038f48c2dde9beb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b44c045f0903136eda367ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经堆了十个以上的雪人了！\r\n广场上那个你的雪雕，\r\n就是我的杰作哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c9239d6b8346b0cde771327c2e44dbc21628989b089d69be4d3e604b9d06ec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "90009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
